elder for. Alltid en time etter START_TID</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a2e294c5-da44-4bcd-bb7f-ccf16369afc2\"><p local-id=\"18d0df4a-ad99-4434-8750-26f64eba01a8\"><ac:link ac:local-id=\"0f3daa29ef20\" ac:card-appearance=\"inline\" ac:anchor=\"Tid\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Datatyper\" ri:version-at-save=\"63\" /><ac:link-body>Datatyper</ac:link-body></ac:link> </p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"662dc5a8-5bed-409d-ba1d-e888c57a5341\"><th ac:local-id=\"e4182800-8c06-4ffe-89c0-55b1a5c8fc4a\"><p local-id=\"525837b7-79b1-4a4b-a5be-1f331b868d6d\"><strong>3</strong></p></th><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\" ac:local-id=\"c782ad9f-4cd0-4aee-a77d-5ae3d24cdf9f\"><p local-id=\"a2580e4c-637e-409e-8fda-f2b95c454491\">PRISOMR&Aring;DE</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"aa0eade4-3c22-4800-bf66-06f4e4f088e6\"><p local-id=\"7c5c210c-c895-40e8-af5b-f0389061cd6a\">Prisomr&aring;de/budomr&aring;de. Datasettet omfatter kun de s&oslash;rlige prisomr&aring;dene(NO1, NO2 og NO5.)</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"547f66e5-e4ea-497d-b948-7c4d929c3d72\"><p local-id=\"19073429-61b5-4929-9041-cfa0420bc12d\"><ac:link ac:local-id=\"788d4384cb62\" ac:card-appearance=\"inline\" ac:anchor=\"Prisomr%C3%A5de\"><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Datatyper\" ri:version-at-save=\"63\" /><ac:link-body>Datatyper</ac:link-body></ac:link> </p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"0464b53e-e14b-4eed-8cf0-24eec8ddb892\"><th ac:local-id=\"750848a6-6322-4dd8-9ca2-3cc27a8cea49\"><p local-id=\"1a5b3009-16c2-48ef-a273-8e8f44f3831e\"><strong>4</strong></p></th><td data-highlight-colour=\"#f4f5f7\" ac:local-id=\"fddac7fb-df23-4041-a9ec-4a539ab04b0c\"><p local-id=\"162d6134-ff98-4307-8ac8-160844289e0b\">ESTIMERT_&Aring;RLIG_FORBRUK_GRUPPE</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a8dfcebf-b36c-4fcd-98c4-2e4b2f6ad1ff\"><p local-id=\"c9b3218dfb3f\">Forbruksgruppe basert p&aring; estimert &aring;rsforbruk (EAC). Verdier: <code>Husholdning Lav</code> <code>Husholdning Medium</code> og <code>Husholdning H&oslash;y</code></p></td><td ac:local-id=\"90024352-4873-493b-9693